    "long_instructions": "## Inspect and Convert Technology Data\r\n\r\nThe program loads `technology_survey.csv` into a DataFrame named `survey_data`.\r\n\r\n### Do This:\r\n\r\n1. Use `info()` and `describe()` to examine the dataset.\r\n\r\n2. Use `astype()` to convert:\r\n\r\n   * `StudentID` to `int64`\r\n   * `InternetSpeedMbps` to `float64`\r\n\r\n3. Use `pd.to_datetime()` to convert `LastPost`.\r\n\r\n4. Use `info()` again to verify the conversions. Run the program to view the provided graph.\r\n\r\n::: details [Need help?]\r\n\r\nUse AI Tutor to:\r\n\r\n* View examples using different data\r\n* Learn how a pandas function works\r\n* Understand unfamiliar code or an error message\r\n\r\nThen use what you learn to write your own code.\r\n\r\n:::",
